ist-item osano-cm-list-item "> <!--?lit$26778615731$-->Measure the audience of the advertising on our website, without profiling </li><!----><!----><li class=" osano-cm-list__list-item osano-cm-list-item "> <!--?lit$26778615731$-->Display personalized ads based on your navigation and your profile </li><!----><!----><li class=" osano-cm-list__list-item osano-cm-list-item "> <!--?lit$26778615731$-->Personalize our editorial content based on your navigation </li><!----><!----><li class=" osano-cm-list__list-item osano-cm-list-item "> <!--?lit$26778615731$-->Allow you to share content on social networks or platforms present on our website </li><!----><!----><li class=" osano-cm-list__list-item osano-cm-list-item "> <!--?lit$26778615731$-->Send you advertising based on your location </li><!----> </ul> </p>  <!--?lit$26778615731$--><!--?lit$26778615731$--><a rel="noopener" tabindex="0" href="https://www.ieee.org/security-privacy.html" target="_blank" class=" osano-cm-storage-policy osano-cm-content__link osano-cm-link " aria-describedby="osano-cm-aria.newWindow"><!--?lit$26778615731$-->Privacy Policy</a><!--?--><!--?lit$26778615731$--> <!--?lit$26778615731$--> <!--?lit$26778615731$--> <!--?lit$26778615731$--> </div> <!--?lit$26778615731$--> <div class="osano-cm-dialog__buttons osano-cm-buttons"> <!--?lit$26778615731$--><!--?lit$26778615731$--><!--?lit$26778615731$--><button class=" osano-cm-manage osano-cm-buttons__button osano-cm-button osano-cm-button--type_manage " tabindex="0"> <!--?lit$26778615731$-->Manage Preferences </button><!--?--><!--?--> <!--?lit$26778615731$--><!--?lit$26778615731$--><button class=" osano-cm-accept-all osano-cm-buttons__button osano-cm-button osano-cm-button--type_accept " tabindex="0"> <!--?lit$26778615731$-->Accept All </button><!--?--> <!--?lit$26778615731$--><!--?lit$26778615731$--><!--?lit$26778615731$--><button class=" osano-cm-denyAll osano-cm-buttons__button osano-cm-button osano-cm-button--type_denyAll " tabindex="0"> <!--?lit$267786